    advanced: "The 'Diamond Sweep': If you are trailing in points, focus entirely on the 'Most Diamonds' category. Even if you lose individual tricks, capturing 6 or 7 Diamonds will guarantee you 2 points at the end of the round (Diamond count + 7 of Diamonds).",
    tips: [
      {
        title: 'Tip',
        description: "Count the 7s. There are only four. If three have been played, the last 7 becomes a powerful 'Shokoba' tool.",
      },
      {
        title: 'Tip',
        description: "If playing in teams, watch what your partner leaves on the table. Try to 'setup' a sum for them if you suspect they have a high-value card.",
